{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act23side_level_act23side_06_end",
  "groupId": "act23side",
  "stageId": "act23side_06",
  "title": "瑟瑟秋華",
  "storyCode": "WB-6",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a7814c543418c77037dbd3e668f68b183fdcbb80c2cae56f13cf1c50a688590f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g6_yumengate"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（這些人配合還真默契......到底還有多少人？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "長相兇狠的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（低沉的嘶吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_794_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，這些人為什麼突然間都不打了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們為什麼要找你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你叫什麼名字？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "槐琥。槐樹的槐，琥珀的琥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "槐琥......我記住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我叫截雲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等我回來的時候，也會來找你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奇怪的人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是先去抓那些壞人吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g7_zuosroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人的目光在地圖上遊移，勾勒出一條航線。\n他看得很慢，他知道圖紙上的每一寸畫面，象徵的是何等遼闊的土地。\n桌案一旁的茶杯裡，早已沒了熱氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這玉門的粗茶，還以為太傅會喝不慣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "留守這裡的將士百姓喝的都是這種茶，我如何喝不得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天氣還未變暖，不適宜喝這涼茶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太傅縫補天下事，卻唯獨沒將自己的身體放在心上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要是倒下了，讓其他人如何是好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我若是倒下了，自然會有更優秀的後來人接替我的位置。江山代有才俊，炎國沒有離不開誰的道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "流水不腐，戶樞不蠹。重要的不是一人一世，而是傳承。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人生代代，自古如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“傳承”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對我們來說，恐怕是很難理解的一個詞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你還是教出了無數於大炎有用的人才。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歷任錄武官對武學招式的記錄還留作軍隊的訓練教材，在軍務上，連我也受過你不少指點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可歸根結底，我，我們，各自那一技之長，還是以人為師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "重岳倒掉了杯中變涼的茶水，又重新添上熱茶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們什麼時候也變得這樣生疏了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當年一同挑燈議事，以劍為筆指點江山，從未忘懷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但身份畢竟不同昔日。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我有些冒昧了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "宗師今日竟會主動來找我，應該不只是敘舊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "的確。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是來與太傅告別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_warehouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "林特使，又見面了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上一次見面，好像才是兩天前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我看來，這兩天發生的事，已經比過去二十年都多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在想一想，前天你出手，與其說是救我，不如說是攔住我不讓我繼續追查。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那也算救你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是聽說龍門近衛局派來了一位臨時督察，負責兩城對接的治安事宜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這兩天你為了查案在集市和鑄劍坊鬧出的動靜，我實在和眼前這樣一位年輕的姑娘對不上號。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "林特使從一開始就鎖定了我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，是在剛剛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在你出現在這裡之前，我都並不確定這些事情出自你的手筆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "僅僅是懷疑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "懷疑就夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很“特別”的行事風格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一直都這樣。你是想說“不夠光明磊落”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你作為玉門的老人，做的這許多事，未必就體面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "林特使罵的是。不過你倒是說說，“許多事”，具體指哪些？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "勾結山海眾，偽造流寇截殺信使的現場，再上演一齣襲擊我的戲碼，將已經調換的假天災數據“變成真的”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "同時還另外找人盜走宗師佩劍，掩人耳目。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "盜劍在我的意料之外，不然也不會有昨天晚上的事情......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但能算到調換數據這步，林特使聰慧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多虧你還留有一點仁慈，沒有真的殺了信使隊伍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是否也能讓我問一個問題——為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特使想必已經有答案了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你對平祟侯有怨，就要引一場天災，毀掉整座玉門城？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們和左宣遼，不只是一同出生入死的交情。“怨”這個字，太輕了點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "左宣遼，也將我們看得太輕了點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "林特使，是龍門人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽說是個好地方，很繁華，只可惜，從來沒去過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玉門你也看到了，常年穿行在大漠。冒著天災送回軍情急報，在茫茫沙海連續獨行幾個日夜尋找水源......你肯定沒有經歷過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戍守邊疆，保家衛國，這些事情，總要有人做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玉門的軍人和百姓，絕大多數都不是本地人，我們離開家鄉，扎根在這，也從沒怨過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "左宣遼不該忘了，玉門成為大炎最堅固的屏障，不是他一個人的功勞，他有什麼資格趕這些為玉門流過血的人走？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你大概是誤會了平祟侯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那宗師他，為何要離開玉門？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我更不理解，你為什麼打算親手毀掉自己守護了這麼多年的城市？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你以為，千百年來，玉門遭受過多少次天災？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "區區一場天災，不僅不會毀了玉門，還能重新讓這裡的人們上下一心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......瘋子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "倉庫一角，兩個年輕人面色憔悴，愁眉苦臉地縮著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大小齊......你們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其他人呢？守軍和信使怎麼樣了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年輕的鏢客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就在剛剛，被鑄劍坊的孟老頭，放走了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事就好，沒事就好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年輕的鏢客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小......小姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年輕的鏢客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這趟鏢，我們沒護好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年輕的鏢客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們壓根沒弄清楚什麼情況，隊伍裡鑄劍坊的那幾個人突然就出手打暈了我們，醒來的時候就在倉庫裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年輕的鏢客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們到底想幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三兩句說不清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行了！一個個都哭喪著臉幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年輕的鏢客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這可是我們行裕物流的第一趟工作，就......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第一趟工作，就遇上這麼件大事，說明我們行裕物流未來的生意小不了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別愁眉苦臉哭哭啼啼的，快跟我走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g7_zuosroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "劍的下落，有了些眉目。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實從一開始，你就有數。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一點私心，瞞不過太傅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人難免有私心的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要這點私心，於公義無礙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這把劍該託付給誰，我大概有了人選。只是最後一道考驗，我想去親眼看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，也得太傅允許才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你說的告別，應該不只是這個意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前路未卜，後會無期，是該好好告別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玉門此行的終點，是京城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祂也快要醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人轉過身，再次將目光投向那一紙地圖。在那上面，他看到了許多，想到了許多。\n他突然想問一個問題，一個作為“太傅”原本不會問出的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你會覺得遺憾嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聚散有時，強求圓滿未必就能不留遺憾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是偶爾會想，其實自己能做的事情並不算多......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玉門城，本是千年前為那場狩獵而建造的堡壘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以玉門城的英雄，可以是出身草莽的豪傑，也可以是天資卓然的長生種，但唯獨不能是巨獸的化身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是司歲台無論如何都要守住的秘密。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人活著，總不能指望處處都被體諒理解......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "男人緩步走到老人身側，兩人望著同一幅江山圖畫，一時無言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果不出意外，玉門會在半年後靠近京城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "地圖上標出的這些位置，是玉門抵達京城前，預計要疏散百姓的地點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果事情發展到那一步，玉門要做好與歲獸同歸於盡的準備，這是大炎必須要承擔的代價。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在二十年前，山海眾現身作亂。事情平息後，早在司歲台趕來善後之前，平祟侯便找過我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他在那時就意識到，歲獸依然是炎國的一大隱患。玉門，恐怕遲早會回歸它最初的戰場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而那時，玉門不能依賴我，也不能依賴那些江湖義士。到最後，所有人都是要走的。這被許多人當作家的地方，恐怕也會灰飛煙滅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "外人只道平祟侯不念舊情，但其中的考量，他又能與誰說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和他，本來有一群共同的朋友......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "擔重任者，不能困於私情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二十年來的恩怨糾紛，有誤會，有怨恨，但總需要一個結束。我應該親自去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是出於私情的請求，不敢說求太傅體諒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......但我並非不通人情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“朔”是那隻罪獸的一部分，但“重岳”，於大炎百姓有恩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太傅的意思......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "平祟侯的軍令，是讓宗師保護我的安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "宗師若能護玉門周全，我又怎會出事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......多謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "男人轉身離開軍帳，輕輕帶上了門。\n老人對屋外的方向，微微頷首。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g8_yumenarena"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魏公這是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "城中緝寇，我也能出一份力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "順便送宗師一程。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_warehouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "空氣一片死寂，沙礫落在瓦簷上的聲音清晰可聞。\n密閉的倉庫看不到外面，林雨霞還在努力聽著屋外的響動，時間一分一秒地流逝，不知遠方的天災雲是否又靠近了幾分。\n晚來風急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "林特使看起來很著急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難為林特使陪我這個老頭子聊到現在。你無非是猜，我可能還留著天災信使帶回來的真實數據。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拿去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你沒有理由平白無故地把東西給我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我算過了，拖到這個時候，欽天監即使拿到真實數據，玉門也不可能避過這場天災。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "另外，想向林特使說明，整件事情因我一人而起，被帶走的那些武人兄弟的確是無辜的，希望林特使明察。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "置一城的人於危難，難得你還有“無辜”的概念。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天災人禍，一碼歸一碼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你拖延我到現在，應該還另有目的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然。這種時候，不該做浪費時間的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原本答應了要幫一位故人出城。昨晚鑄劍坊出事後，也只能爽約了。只好多吸引些注意力在我自己身上，好讓她順利出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個盜劍的人？我記得你說盜劍也在你的意料之外......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "林特使確實是聰明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這又是一筆糊塗帳，就不足為外人道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓該走的人走，該算帳的人算清帳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "林特使，拿到了想要的東西，就趕緊走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實還有一點，你沒有說到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和我有仇有怨的，可不止是左宣遼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特意約這個時間，這個地點，也是想讓另一批人找過來，順便把另一筆舊帳給了了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到處躲，找你不容易。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你背棄了我們的合作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
